        },
        {
          "text": "na ananĩ makwa onthe (nũndũ Yeova nũnengete ana aingĩ), nũnyuvĩte Solomoni mwana wakwa ekale kĩvĩlanĩ kya ũsumbĩ kya Yeova asumbĩke Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
