              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ambĩa, Solomoni mwana waku, nĩwe ũkaka nyũmba yakwa na nza syakwa; nũndũ nĩnĩmũnyuvĩte ethĩwe mwana wakwa, nakwa ngeethĩwa ĩthe wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
